      "structure_description": "A fused bi-nanopillar Dy/O core built from vertex-sharing Dy3(μ3-OH)4 and Dy5(μ4-O)(μ3-OH)8 units. Its three layers contain 19, 38, and 19 Dy atoms; chloride and carbonate anions occupy cavities. Fusion of two Dy48 pillars is the authors’ proposed assembly model, not an observed intermediate."
