      "structure_description": "The separately deposited product of transforming Dy76 has nearly the same Dy48 mono-nanopillar skeleton as Dy48. In Dy48-T, all 16 L1 ligands are coordinated, whereas four of the corresponding L1 ligands in Dy48 are uncoordinated; the reported counterions and lattice contents also differ."
